@startuml
actor Student
boundary QuizInterface
control QuizController
control QuizManagementService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

Student -> QuizInterface: Access quizzes
QuizInterface -> QuizController: Request list of available quizzes
QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Fetch list of quizzes
QuizManagementService -> Database: Retrieve quiz data
Database --> QuizManagementService: Return quiz data
QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide quiz data
QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display quizzes with reward points

Student -> QuizInterface: Select a quiz and start attempt
QuizInterface -> QuizController: Request quiz questions
QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Fetch quiz questions
QuizManagementService -> Database: Retrieve questions
Database --> QuizManagementService: Return questions
QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide questions
QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display questions

Student -> QuizInterface: Submit quiz answers
QuizInterface -> QuizController: Submit answers
QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Process answers
QuizManagementService -> Database: Store answers and calculate score
Database --> QuizManagementService: Return calculation results
QuizManagementService -> Database: Calculate and update reward points
Database --> QuizManagementService: Update reward points

QuizManagementService -> QuizController: Provide quiz results and reward points
QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display quiz results and reward points

QuizManagementService -> NotificationService: Notify student of reward points
NotificationService -> Student: Send reward points notification

QuizManagementService -> QuizController: Update student profile with reward points
QuizController -> QuizInterface: Display updated student profile

@enduml
